+### 4.3 list_conversations
+
+Requests a list of the user's conversations, newest activity first. This frame is answered off the per-session lock: it does not wait for a streaming response to finish ([validated by: answers list_conversations for the authenticated user with ISO dates, forwarding limit and before while ignoring any client userId](../../src/transport/conversationList.acceptance.test.ts#L61)).
+
+```json
+{
+  "type": "list_conversations",
+  "limit": 10,
+  "before": {
+    "updatedAt": "2026-01-01T00:05:00.000Z",
+    "sessionId": "s3"
+  }
+}
+```
+
+| Field    | Type   | Required | Description                          |
+| -------- | ------ | -------- | ------------------------------------ |
+| `type`   | string | Yes      | `"list_conversations"`               |
+| `limit`  | number | No       | How many rows to return (1-200)      |
+| `before` | object | No       | Paging cursor from the last row seen |
+
+The `before` cursor MUST carry both `updatedAt` (ISO string or epoch) and `sessionId`, providing a tie-break when two conversations share an activity time.
 
